QUESTION 12: Branches with Average Balance Greater Than 1,000?
==============================================================================

Only the Account table is required:

SELECT branch_name,
       AVG(balance) AS average_balance
FROM account
GROUP BY branch_name
HAVING AVG(balance) > 1000;

If customer details are also required:

SELECT a.branch_name,
       AVG(a.balance) AS average_balance
FROM customer c
JOIN account a
  ON c.account_number = a.account_number
GROUP BY a.branch_name
HAVING AVG(a.balance) > 1000;

WHERE filters rows. HAVING filters grouped results.

