QUESTION 51: Transaction Propagation?
==============================================================================

REQUIRED:
Join current transaction or create one. Default.

REQUIRES_NEW:
Suspend current transaction and create a new one.

SUPPORTS:
Use current transaction if present; otherwise run without one.

MANDATORY:
Must already have a transaction.

NOT_SUPPORTED:
Suspend current transaction and run without one.

NEVER:
Fail if a transaction exists.

NESTED:
Use a savepoint when supported.

