QUESTION 60: Retry Pattern?
==============================================================================

Retry repeats a failed operation when the failure is temporary.

@Retryable(
    retryFor = ResourceAccessException.class,
    maxAttempts = 3,
    backoff = @Backoff(delay = 1000, multiplier = 2)
)
public PaymentResponse callDownstream() {
    return restClient.call();
}

@Recover
public PaymentResponse recover(
        ResourceAccessException ex) {
    return PaymentResponse.failed();
}

Use retry with:

Timeout
Backoff
Maximum attempts
Circuit breaker
Monitoring
Idempotent operation

Do not retry permanent validation failures.

